  (text "DISPLAY: HH:MM:SS.mmm, 9 digits, each statically driven by a 74HCT595 (5 V)." (at 190 22 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6f16d6b3-8d9b-5c08-ae8e-255a568cbf52))
  (text "Chain: SR_DATA -> U11 -> U12 ... -> U19. All latch together on SR_LATCH. /OE = PWM brightness." (at 190 28 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cf77b90c-d23e-55d0-9ce8-655dd19c9e24))
  (text "Segment resistors 470R: ~5.7-6.4 mA per LED. 8 LEDs per 595 (~46-51 mA); U12/U14 drive 9 (~51-58 mA). Limit 70 mA." (at 190 33 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 59351181-a442-5fdb-b958-56c0944fd571))
  (text "All 74 LEDs on: ~0.42-0.47 A from 5 V. Firmware must cap /OE duty for an all-segments self-test." (at 190 38 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ad167214-ea3e-5e16-b3b2-74a414c6e890))
